function [o] = drag_cannonball(r, v, rho, cd, area, mass, wind, omega)
%DRAG_CANNONBALL  drag.cannonball(r, v, rho, Cd, A, opts): -1/2 Cd A rho |v_r| v_r / m, v_r = v - omega x r - wind.
%   r: real[1][3] (passed a plain number)
